model g7_deep_plan
  tally 2
  on 2026-02-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, issue #41, G7: flows of a move whose leg the walk refuses (E §4.2 step 5, L §5.14.3), asked first, when the plan pass of the walk it needs reads, in a plan's amount in January, a def forty links deep; the leg, into a place after its lifespan, comes in February, so the flows read is refused (RUN-LIFESPAN); beside it the plan's place, answered."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index n = 1..40

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_deep: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place old: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..2026-01-31

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input one: num

input top: int

input deep_day: date

input pay_day: date

input pay_amt: money PLN

input small: money PLN

input big: money PLN

def acc[k in n]: num
  note "a chain of forty links, each reading the one before"
  rule base v facts = if k == one then one else acc[k - one] + one

move deep: transfers
  on deep_day
  leg cash from world to p_deep amount if acc[top] > 0 then small else big

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from world to old amount pay_amt

ask a_flows: flows(pay, 2026-02-01 .. 2026-02-28) law cut

ask b_bal: bal(p_deep, 2026-01-31), flows(pay, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31) law cut

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  one = 1
  top = 40 "the chain's last link"
  deep_day = 2026-01-10 "the plan reading the chain"
  pay_day = 2026-02-05 "into old after its lifespan"
  pay_amt = 50.00
  small = 1.00
  big = 100.00

version openings
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-31
  opening[konto] = 1000 at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[p_deep] = 0 at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[old] = 0 at 2026-01-01 start
